                                "sense_id": "5d29de99-41c7-342d-a0fa-ea47b08a857c",
                                "text": "Some comical defending involving two terrible clearances saw Kingson called on to block Welbeck's strike and then Evatt made amends for his shocking miscue by heading Bent's powerful follow-up over the bar."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "47613b83-42a8-4619-a288-f845e4c8bbef",
                                "sense_id": "5d29de99-41c7-342d-a0fa-ea47b08a857c",
                                "text": "All season, the Chiefs have struggled on offense, in particular in the pass catching department. On multiple occasions throughout the regular season, Mahomes was burned by mental miscues from his wide receivers which cost the Chiefs wins."
                            }
                        ]
